    },
    {
      "title": "Solve the elemental lattice puzzle",
      "text": "Use the lever interface (bottom-right) to solve the puzzle — the helper highlights the exact lever to pull each move, in order, through every section: connect the right counter (north then south), the left counter (north then south), then lower, spin and raise the central tower. It highlights the Reset lever between sections, and if you pull a wrong lever it points you at Undo or Reset to recover.",
