    {
      "text": "If your puzzle was in the \u0027guide position\u0027 mentioned above, pull the levers in the following order:\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e2 (The tower drops)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e4, B (The tower spins)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eC, 3 (The tower rises)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e",
